{"version":1,"content":"<p>三星近日宣佈，其流動維修服務已在歐洲12個國家完成超過5萬次手機和平板電腦維修。該服務於去年7月啓動，旨在讓用户無需親自前往維修中心即可獲得設備維修支持。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587236.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T06:44:07.207935+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T06:23:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T06:37:14.515185+00:00","content_hash":"e8b92ae5a6d56fd19222ef9fd90015bceaf3f9c83253b5f0b8646352986239c5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}